---
/**
 * The line under the light band: "20 barn, 20 ljus." and why the association is small. Shared by LightBand
 * and the Christmas campaign's own text, so the line is written once. Put it in a <p>.
 * `tone="ink"` is for a light background, where the bold part is ink instead of cotton.
 */
interface Props {
  tone?: "cotton" | "ink";
}
const { tone = "cotton" } = Astro.props;
---

<strong class:list={["font-semibold", tone === "ink" ? "text-ink" : "text-cotton"]}>20 barn, 20 ljus.</strong> Vi är små med flit, så att stödet når fram och
vi känner varje familj.
